<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 71,520.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 71,520.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of November 25 totaled 71,520 bales, up from 71,118 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 406 bales issued, no decertification orders, four cancellations, and 1,945 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk 212 859 1640</p>
</text>
